  "id": "epp-server-lfi",
  "name": "EPP Server - Local File Inclusion",
  "author": "DhiyaneshDK",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "description": "servlet called \"CitiesServlet\" that handles HTTP GET requests, so the user-provided input, obtained from the country parameter, is directly concatenated with the \"/cities/cities_\" string to form the fileName, This means an attacker can manipulate the country parameter and potentially access arbitrary files on the server\u0027s file system\n",
  "references": [
    "https://hackcompute.com/hacking-epp-servers/"
  ],
